  {
   "id": "holography-koopman",
   "label": {
    "en": "Holography and Koopman: two faces of one inverse problem",
    "zh": "全息 ↔ Koopman:同一个反问题的两副面孔"
   },
   "description": {
    "en": "Holography generates geometry from entanglement; a general learning machine learns an eigenbasis of its own dynamics. Same inverse problem: recover an operator's eigenstructure from what it does. The HaPPY code is the physical twin of 'forgetting is compression, not deletion'.",
    "zh": "全息原理从纠缠结构里生成几何;一台通用学习机学习它自身动力学的本征基。同一个反问题:从算子做了什么反推它的本征结构。HaPPY 码是「遗忘是压缩、不是删除」的物理孪生。"
   },
   "url": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/holography-koopman.md",
   "format": "text/markdown",
   "inLanguage": "en",
   "workTranslation": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/holography-koopman.zh.md",
   "cognitiveState": "speculative",
   "confidence": 0.5,
   "edges": [
    {
     "relation": "supports",
     "target": "state-as-closure"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "state-as-closure",
   "label": {
    "en": "State is a closure condition, not a given set",
    "zh": "State 是一个闭包条件,不是给定的集合"
   },
   "description": {
    "en": "Treats task-relative state as a closure representation under (world, interface, capacity, telos), explicitly as inference rather than universal ontology. The 2026 amendment scopes causal-state and Mori-Zwanzig results, distinguishes policy classes from physical reachable sets, and classifies J-space as transient workspace evidence. OpenAI's non-sofic-group and Connes-rigidity results are used only as finite-approximability and substrate-identifiability constraints.",
    "zh": "把任务相对 state 视为(world、interface、capacity、telos)下的闭包表示,明确标作推断而非普适本体论。2026 修订收窄 causal-state 与 Mori-Zwanzig 结论,区分策略类与物理可达集,并把 J-space 归为瞬时 workspace 证据。OpenAI 的 non-sofic group 与 Connes rigidity 结果只作为有限可近似性和 substrate 可辨识性约束。"
   },
   "url": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/state-as-closure.md",
   "format": "text/markdown",
   "inLanguage": "en",
   "workTranslation": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/state-as-closure.zh.md",
   "cognitiveState": "speculative",
   "confidence": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "discounted-credit-cokernel",
   "label": {
    "en": "Discounted credit is a cokernel problem, not a loop holonomy",
    "zh": "折扣信用分配是余核问题，不是闭环 holonomy"
   },
   "description": {
    "en": "A formal correction and executable finite-graph result. On a simple directed cycle and 0<=gamma<1, the discounted incidence operator is invertible, so the earlier M=4.095 candidate-potential defect was not a gauge-invariant holonomy and is withdrawn. The corrected object is the weighted reward residual modulo the image of the discounted incidence operator across the entire observed edge system. Exact balanced-alias enumeration gives 42/45 generically non-exact maps under the historical filter. A Cartesian 2x2 definition check independently varies this representation obstruction and strategic harmonic flow; targeted repair in one coupled learner remains the next experiment.",
    "zh": "一次正式纠错与可执行有限图结果。简单有向环在 0<=gamma<1 时折扣关联算子可逆，因此旧 M=4.095 候选势缺陷不是 gauge-invariant holonomy，现已撤回。正确对象是全部已观测转移类型构成的边系统上，奖励场模去折扣关联算子像空间后的加权残差。平衡 alias 的精确枚举在历史筛选下给出 42/45 一般不可解。Cartesian 2x2 定义检查独立改变表征障碍与策略 harmonic flow；在同一个耦合 learner 中执行定向修复仍是下一实验。"
   },
   "url": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/discounted-credit-is-a-cokernel.md",
   "format": "text/markdown",
   "inLanguage": "en",
   "workTranslation": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/discounted-credit-is-a-cokernel.zh.md",
   "cognitiveState": "survived",
   "confidence": 0.95,
   "edges": [
    {
     "relation": "supports",
     "target": "state-as-closure"
    },
    {
     "relation": "corrects",
     "target": "no-state-only-history"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "odd-relational-core",
   "label": {
    "en": "The odd relational core: anti-bipartiteness as the minimal structure",
    "zh": "奇关系核:反二分作为最小结构"
   },
   "description": {
    "en": "Why civilizational compression schemes (triadic deities, five phases, seven chakras) keep landing on small, odd, centered, ever-turning relational cores. One hard graph-theory kernel — two-coloring holds iff no odd cycle, so an odd cycle is the cheapest structure that topologically refuses an us-vs-them binary terminus, while a binary scheme natively supplies a final enemy — wrapped in a four-pressure framework the note's own adversarial audit then dismantles: 'odd' is demoted to a corollary of 'anti-binary', two of the four pressures are re-read as exaptations, and the moral reading is a hypothesis, not a conclusion.",
    "zh": "为什么文明的压缩图式(三相神、五行、七脉轮)反复落到小、奇、有心、不停转的关系核。一个硬的图论内核——二染色当且仅当无奇环,所以奇环是最省的、拓扑上拒绝「我们vs他们」二分终局的结构,而二元图式天然提供一个最终敌人——外面包着一个四股压力框架,然后被 note 自己的对抗自审拆掉:「奇」被降级为「反二元」的 corollary、四股里两股被重读成 exaptation、道德读法只是假设不是结论。"
   },
   "url": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/odd-relational-core.md",
   "format": "text/markdown",
   "inLanguage": "en",
   "workTranslation": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/odd-relational-core.zh.md",
   "cognitiveState": "speculative",
   "confidence": 0.4,
   "edges": [
    {
     "relation": "supports",
     "target": "state-as-closure"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "two-body-karma",
   "label": {
    "en": "Two-body karma: three modes of relational inertia",
    "zh": "两体业力:关系里的三种惯性"
   },
   "description": {
    "en": "Extends a single-mind account of habit inertia (mud, spring, latch) to two coupled minds: the inertia lives in the coupling itself, not in either person. Shared mud is scene-keyed sedimentation of default scripts; the mutual spring is the model of you stored in the other's head, an external memory of your old pattern that makes unilateral self-reform systematically fail until it is retrained by announcement plus repeated demonstration; the interlocked latch is a bistable relational state with hysteresis that flips only when both sides cross the threshold together. Goal is not zero coupling but a negotiable spring. The dynamical-systems language is marked as structural rhyme, not derivation; the note closes with the observations that would break it.",
    "zh": "把单人版的习气-惯性三模式(泥、弹簧、卡扣)扩展到两个人的关系:惯性存在耦合本身,不在任何一方体内。共泥=双侧沉积、场景键控的默认脚本;互弹簧=对方脑中那个「你的模型」,是你旧模式的外部存储器,让单方面修行系统性失效,直到用明说加反复演把它重训;互锁卡扣=关系状态的双稳加滞回,只有双方同时跨阈才翻转。目标不是零耦合,而是可协商的弹簧。动力学语言被标注为结构性押韵而非推导;文末给出能拆掉框架的可观察证据。"
   },
   "url": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/two-body-karma.md",
   "format": "text/markdown",
   "inLanguage": "zh-Hans",
   "cognitiveState": "speculative",
   "confidence": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "learning-the-self-boundary",
   "label": {
    "en": "Learning where the self ends",
    "zh": "学习「我到哪里为止」"
   },
   "description": {
    "en": "A proposal that a robot should learn the agent/environment boundary rather than be handed it by an engineer, and the one-day campaign in which three of its four supporting claims were destroyed, every one of them by the authors' own simulator or own re-analysis. Survived: hysteresis in the boundary emerges from a self-reinforcing precision loop with no hand-installed non-linearity, and survives extrapolation to zero sweep rate at 24-35x the resolution floor. Died: self-specificity, because raising one free amplitude makes a wind-blown ball's boundary stick digit-for-digit identically, so hysteresis is a generic property of any gated slow variable; the signature prediction that release is slower than incorporation, falsified in both implementations with the asymmetry reversed in the second for a computable reason, namely that precision amplifies the evidence against a channel just as much; and the claim that any of it falls out of the proposed objective, which in fact requires a cost/benefit ratio hand-tuned to about 2% and places every channel 2-420 window-widths outside it. The human-side motivation rested on an unreferenced claim of empirical establishment; two independent public datasets re-analysed here both point to adaptation, the opposite sign. Written in two layers: a jargon-free narrative, then the full measured record. Not ratified, not a result.",
    "zh": "一个提案:机器人应该学出 agent/环境边界,而不是被工程师递给它;以及一天之内四条支撑主张倒掉三条的过程,每一条都是被自己的仿真器或自己的重分析打倒的。活下来:边界的滞回确实能从自我强化的精度回路里涌现,不需手装非线性,且通过零扫速外推,达分辨底的 24-35 倍。死掉:自我特异性,因为把一个自由幅度拧大,一个被风吹的球的边界卡得逐位相同,所以滞回是任何带门控慢变量的通用性质;「释放比并入更慢」这条签名预测在两种实现下都被证伪,第二种里方向还反了,原因可算,即精度同样放大反对该通道的证据;以及「这一切从提出的目标函数里自然长出」,实际需要手调到约 2% 的成本收益比,而目标函数把每条通道放在窗口外 2 到 420 个窗口宽。人类侧动机压在一句无出处的「经验上确凿」上;本文重分析的两份独立公开数据都指向适应,即相反符号。双层写作:先无术语叙事,再完整实测记录。未 ratify,不是结论。"
   },
   "url": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/learning-the-self-boundary.md",
   "format": "text/markdown",
   "inLanguage": "en",
   "workTranslation": "https://machengshen.github.io/theory/learning-the-self-boundary.zh.md",
   "cognitiveState": "speculative",
   "confidence": 0.15,
   "edges": [
