    "en": "Error, value, and viability signals must propagate backward through every structure that caused an outcome; neural backprop is one projection of that. The claim is live and untested. It is NOT the same claim as the wave-equation derivation, which was the strong form and is retired — see wave-backprop-derivation. This node has no URL of its own precisely because that distinction was previously collapsed: the graph pointed at the retired page and called it speculative.",
    "zh": "误差、价值与生存信号必须沿着一切造成了结果的结构反向传播;神经网络的反向传播只是它的一个投影。这条主张仍然活着,且未经检验。它**不等于**那条从波动方程出发的推导——那是它的强形式,已被 retire,见 wave-backprop-derivation。"
   },
