  {
   "id": "credit-routing-scalar",
   "label": {
    "en": "Ranking institutions by a scalar credit-transport fidelity score",
    "zh": "用一个标量的 credit-transport 保真度给制度排名"
   },
   "description": {
    "en": "A tempting move: assign each institution one scalar credit-routing fidelity number, by analogy to a loss gradient, and rank institutions by it. Rejected in the essay. Credit in a social structure is multi-dimensional, the backward pass is not differentiable, and collapsing it to one number is the formalism smuggling in structure the domain does not have.",
    "zh": "一个诱人的动作:类比损失梯度,给每个制度赋一个标量的 credit-routing 保真度,并据此排名。文章里拒绝了它。社会结构里的 credit 是多维的,反向过程不可微,把它压成一个数,是形式主义在偷运这个领域并不具备的结构。"
   },
   "cognitiveState": "retired",
